###Get single employee record by ID
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

###Get employee recording using columns
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees?$select=FirstName,LastName,FullName,Email,Phone

###Get Department records using coloumns
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Departments?$select=DepartmentName,ManagerName

###Get Employee records using filters
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees?$filter=Status eq 'active'

###Get employee recording using pattern match
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees?$filter=contains(FirstName, 'Ra')

###Get employee records count
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees/$count

###Get employee top 2 records
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees?$top=2

###Get employee skip 2 records
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees?$skip=2&top=2

###Get employee records using expand with Department
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees?$expand=Department

###Get employee records using expand with LeaveRequest
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/EmployeeService/Employees?$expand=LeaveRequests

